'''Anti-Qymish sentiment''', also known as '''Qymophobia''', is fear or dislike of [[Qym]], [[Qymish people|its people]], and [[Culture of Qym|its culture]]. Its opposite is [[Qymophilia]]. 

Historically, Qymish rivalries with the [[RIVAL PEOPLE]] and the [[RIVAL PEOPLE]], among others, largely shaped anti-Qymish sentiment in [[Meran]]. 

